### LANGUAGE MANAGEMENT (OWNER ONLY)
### ===============================

### 15. Create New Language (Owner Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "DE",
  "name": "German",
  "nativeName": "Deutsch",
  "flagIcon": "🇩🇪",
  "isRtl": false,
  "displayOrder": 6
}

### 16. Update Language (Owner Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/languages/{{languageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{languageId}}",
  "name": "German (Updated)",
  "nativeName": "Deutsch",
  "flagIcon": "🇩🇪",
  "isRtl": false,
  "isActive": true,
  "displayOrder": 6
}

### 17. Delete Language (Owner Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/languages/{{languageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 18. Update Translation (Owner Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/languages/translations/{{translationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{translationId}}",
  "value": "Güncellenen Değer",
  "category": "common",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

