POST {{baseUrl}}/stock/add
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 10,
  "unitCost": 0,
  "currency": "TRY",
  "referenceType": "Adjustment",
  "description": "Sayım fazlası ekleme"
}

### 36. Check Product Stock Quantity
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ===============================
### INVOICES (FATURALAR)
### ===============================

### 37. Create Sales Invoice (Draft) - Satış Faturası Oluştur
# @name createSalesInvoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 0,
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "invoiceDate": "2025-10-18",
  "dueDate": "2025-11-18",
  "currency": "TRY",
  "notes": "Test satış faturası",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "description": "Test ürün 1",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 1000,
      "discountPercentage": 10
    }
  ]
}

### 38. Extract Invoice ID
@invoiceId = {{createSalesInvoice.response.body.data.id}}

### 39. Create Purchase Invoice (Draft) - Alış Faturası Oluştur
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 1,
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "invoiceDate": "2025-10-18",
  "currency": "TRY",
  "notes": "Test alış faturası",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 100,
      "unitPrice": 800,
      "discountPercentage": 5
    }
  ]
}

### 40. Get All Invoices - Tüm Faturaları Listele
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 41. Get Sales Invoices Only - Sadece Satış Faturaları
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?type=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 42. Get Purchase Invoices Only - Sadece Alış Faturaları
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?type=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 43. Get Issued Invoices - Kesilmiş Faturalar
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?status=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 44. Get Invoices by Customer - Cariye Göre Faturalar
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?customerId={{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 45. Get Invoices by Date Range - Tarih Aralığına Göre
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?startDate=2025-10-01&endDate=2025-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 46. Search Invoices - Fatura Ara
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?searchTerm=INV-2025
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 47. Get Invoice By ID - ID'ye Göre Fatura Detayı
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 48. Issue Invoice - Fatura Kes (Draft → Issued + Stok Hareketi)
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/issue
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
# Expected: 
# - Status changes to Issued
# - Stock movements applied (Sales: decrease, Purchase: increase)
# - FIFO cost calculated for sales

### 49. Cancel Invoice - Faturayı İptal Et
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
# Expected: Status changes to Cancelled

### 50. Try to Issue Already Issued Invoice (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/issue
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
# "Sadece taslak faturalar kesilebilir"

### 51. Create Multi-Currency Invoice - Çok Para Birimli Fatura
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 0,
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "invoiceDate": "2025-10-18",
  "currency": "USD",
  "notes": "Dolar cinsinden fatura",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 100,
      "discountPercentage": 0
    }
  ]
}

