POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 0,
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "invoiceDate": "2025-10-18",
  "currency": "TRY",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 10000,
      "unitPrice": 1000,
      "discountPercentage": 0
    }
  ]
}
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
# "Yetersiz stok! Ürün: ..., Mevcut: ..., İstenen: 10000"

### ===============================
### PAYMENTS (ÖDEMELER)
### ===============================

### 53. Record Payment (Receipt - Müşteriden Tahsilat)
# @name createPayment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 0,
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "invoiceId": "{{invoiceId}}",
  "paymentDate": "2025-10-18",
