### 73. Create Invoice Template (Logo İşbaşı Style)
# @name createTemplate
POST {{baseUrl}}/document-numbering
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentType": "Invoice",
  "subType": "Sales",
  "template": "{PREFIX}{YEAR}{SEQUENCE}",
  "prefix": "VME",
  "includeYear": true,
  "yearFormat": "YYYY",
  "includeMonth": false,
  "sequenceLength": 9,
  "startingNumber": 1,
  "resetFrequency": 1
}

### 74. Extract Template ID
@templateId = {{createTemplate.response.body.data.id}}

