# Verify rate limiting doesn't impact response time significantly

GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 19. Security Headers Performance
# Verify security headers don't impact performance

GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ===== SECURITY BEST PRACTICES =====

### 20. 2FA Best Practices
# 1. Enable 2FA for all admin users
# 2. Save backup codes in password manager
# 3. Regenerate backup codes every 90 days
# 4. Use authenticator app (Google Authenticator, Authy, etc.)
# 5. Don't share backup codes

### 21. API Key Best Practices
# 1. Create separate keys for each integration
# 2. Use IP whitelist when possible
# 3. Set expiration dates (rotate every 90 days)
# 4. Use minimal permissions (least privilege)
# 5. Monitor usage and detect anomalies
# 6. Revoke unused keys immediately

### 22. Rate Limiting Best Practices
# 1. Start with generous limits
# 2. Monitor actual usage patterns
# 3. Adjust limits based on data
# 4. Different limits for different endpoints
# 5. Whitelist trusted IPs if needed
# 6. Strict limits on sensitive endpoints (login, register)

